 ("Stage", "Share of the innings already bowled.", "Stage = legal balls bowled before this ball / 120", "extras_type (to identify legal balls), innings_ball_num", "Every modelled ball", "Assumes a 120-ball innings; rain-revised matches are excluded."),
 ("Pressure Index (PI)", "0-100 measure of how much is at stake on a ball: the match is undecided AND there is little time left.", "PI = 100 x Balance x (0.30 + 0.70 x Stage)", "Derived from Balance and Stage", "188,151 IPL + T20I deliveries", "The 0.30 floor is a judgement; alternatives (0 and 0.5) are tested in the robustness scenarios."),
 ("High-pressure ball", "A ball in the top 25% of Pressure Index within its innings type.", "PI >= 75th percentile of PI, computed separately for 1st innings (56.31) and chases (32.93)", "Derived from PI", "47,038 balls (24,514 first innings, 22,524 chase)", "In the 1st innings this is close to 'later overs of an even game'."),
 ("Expected runs / wickets (context baseline)", "What the average player did on the same kind of ball.", "Average runs per ball (and dismissal rate) within the cell: competition group (IPL / T20I) x innings x phase (overs 1-6, 7-15, 16-20) x pressure state", "runs, is_wicket, dismissal_type, dismissed_player_id, overid, innings; competitions: comp_name, match_format", "24 cells; smallest high-pressure cell shown in the Baselines table", "No adjustment for opposition strength, venue or batting position."),
